    "💡 When a proxy app is running, some apps' network traffic is routed through the proxy,\nso their network activity cannot be observed directly by this app." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "💡 When a proxy app is running, some apps' network traffic is routed through the proxy,\nso their network activity cannot be observed directly by this app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "💡 当代理应用运行时，部分应用的网络流量会被代理路由，\n因此本应用无法直接观测到这些应用的网络活动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "💡 當代理應用運行時，部分應用的網絡流量會被代理路由，\n因此本應用無法直接觀測到這些應用的網絡活動。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "💡 當代理應用運行時，部分應用的網絡流量會被代理路由，\n因此本應用無法直接觀測到這些應用的網絡活動。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "💡 當代理應用運行時，部分應用的網絡流量會被代理路由，\n因此本應用無法直接觀測到這些應用的網絡活動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
