    "If you purchased a subscription on another device, you can restore it by clicking \"Restore Purchases\" below.\n\nMake sure you are signed in with the Apple ID used for the purchase.\n\nOnce restored, all purchased features will be available again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you purchased a subscription on another device, you can restore it by clicking \"Restore Purchases\" below.\n\nMake sure you are signed in with the Apple ID used for the purchase.\n\nOnce restored, all purchased features will be available again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你在其他设备上购买了订阅，可以点击下方的“恢复购买”进行恢复。\n\n请确认你已使用购买时所用的 Apple ID 登录。\n\n恢复后，所有已购功能将重新可用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你在其他設備上購買了訂閱，可以點擊下方的「恢復購買」進行恢復。\n\n請確認你已使用購買時所用的 Apple ID 登錄。\n\n恢復後，所有已購功能將重新可用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你在其他設備上購買了訂閲，可以點擊下方的「恢復購買」進行恢復。\n\n請確認你已使用購買時所用的 Apple ID 登錄。\n\n恢復後，所有已購功能將重新可用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你在其他設備上購買了訂閱，可以點擊下方的「恢復購買」進行恢復。\n\n請確認你已使用購買時所用的 Apple ID 登錄。\n\n恢復後，所有已購功能將重新可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
